{"summary":{"fei":"3003157498","name":"Intas Pharmaceuticals Limited","registrant":"Intas Pharmaceuticals Limited","city":"Ahmedabad","state":"Gujarat","country":"India","countryCode":"IN","lat":22.7813,"lon":72.2708,"precision":"postal","operations":["ANALYSIS","MANUFACTURE","PACK"],"status":"ok","lastActionDate":"2024-07-12","lastActionOk":true,"seriousHistory":true,"lastInspectionDate":"2024-07-12","actions":{"NAI":2,"VAI":7,"OAI":0},"inspections":9,"citations":14,"warningLetters":1,"letter483s":6,"importAlerts":1,"labels":442},"addresses":[{"entity":"Intas Pharmaceuticals Limited","registrant":"Intas Pharmaceuticals Limited","line1":"Plot No. 457/458-Matoda / Plot No.191/218P-Chacharwadi","line2":null,"city":"Ahmedabad","state":"Gujarat","country":"India","zip":"382210","duns":"725927649","operations":["ANALYSIS","MANUFACTURE","PACK"],"expirationDate":"12/31/2025"}],"inspections":[{"id":3793,"date":"2024-07-12","year":2024,"action":"NAI","citations":[]},{"id":16060,"date":"2019-08-02","year":2019,"action":"VAI","citations":[{"id":2,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.22(d)","short":"Procedures not  in writing, fully followed","long":"The responsibilities and procedures applicable to the quality control unit are not in writing."},{"id":397,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.42(c)(10)(iii)","short":"Air Supply","long":"Aseptic processing areas are deficient regarding air supply that is filtered through high-efficiency particulate air filters under positive pressure."},{"id":103,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.42(c)(10)(iv)","short":"Environmental Monitoring System","long":"Aseptic processing areas are deficient regarding the system for monitoring environmental conditions."},{"id":112,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.46(b)","short":"Equipment for Environmental Control","long":"Equipment for adequate control over temperature is not provided when appropriate for the manufacture, processing, packing or holding of a drug product."},{"id":970,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.46(c)","short":"Air recirculation of dust from production areas","long":"Air is recirculated to production areas, without adequate measures to control recirculation of dust."},{"id":3,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.63","short":"Equipment Design, Size and Location","long":"Equipment used in the manufacture, processing, packing or holding of drug products is not of appropriate design, of adequate size, and suitably located to facilitate operations for its intended use."},{"id":62,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.67(b)","short":"Written procedures fail to include","long":"Written procedures for cleaning and maintenance fail to include maintenance and cleaning schedules, description in sufficient detail of methods, equipment and materials used, description in sufficient detail of the methods of disassembling and reassembling equipment as necessary to assure proper cleaning and maintenance, and instructions for removal or obliteration of previous batch identification."},{"id":5,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.100(a)","short":"Absence of Written Procedures","long":"There are no written procedures for production and process controls designed to assure that the drug products have the identity, strength, quality, and purity they purport or are represented to possess."},{"id":56,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.100(b)","short":"Procedure Deviations Recorded and Justified","long":"Deviations from written production and process control procedures are not recorded and justified."},{"id":115,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.113(b)","short":"Procedures for sterile drug products","long":"Procedures designed to prevent microbiological contamination of drug products purporting to be sterile are not written."},{"id":116,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.113(b)","short":"Validation lacking for sterile drug products","long":"Procedures designed to prevent microbiological contamination of drug products purporting to be sterile do not include validation of the sterilization process."},{"id":54,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.160(b)","short":"Scientifically sound laboratory controls","long":"Laboratory controls do not include the establishment of scientifically sound and appropriate test procedures designed to assure that in-process materials conform to appropriate standards of identity, strength, quality and purity."},{"id":10,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.160(b)(4)","short":"Establishment of calibration procedures","long":"Procedures describing the calibration of instruments, apparatus, gauges and recording devices are deficiently written or followed."},{"id":24,"cfr":"21 CFR 211.194(a)(2)","short":"Suitability of testing methods verified","long":"The suitability of all testing methods is not verified under actual conditions of use."}]},{"id":18727,"date":"2018-12-14","year":2018,"action":"NAI","citations":[]},{"id":29442,"date":"2016-06-17","year":2016,"action":"VAI","citations":[]},{"id":34780,"date":"2015-04-07","year":2015,"action":"VAI","citations":[]},{"id":42651,"date":"2013-06-21","year":2013,"action":"VAI","citations":[]},{"id":47539,"date":"2012-05-19","year":2012,"action":"VAI","citations":[]},{"id":50547,"date":"2011-10-10","year":2011,"action":"VAI","citations":[]},{"id":59297,"date":"2009-11-13","year":2009,"action":"VAI","citations":[]}],"warningLetters":[{"id":237,"date":"2023-11-21","company":"Intas Pharmaceuticals Limited","subject":"CGMP/Finished Pharmaceuticals/Adulterated","issuingOffice":"Center for Drug Evaluation and Research | CDER","url":"https://static.propublica.org/fda-inspection-documents/warning-letters/intas-pharmaceuticals-limited-662868-11212023.pdf","closeoutDate":null,"closeoutUrl":null,"responseUrl":null}],"letter483s":[{"id":1420,"date":"2023-05-12","url":"https://static.propublica.org/fda-inspection-documents/483s/2024-10376%2F483s%2F2024-9235%2F2023-5181.pdf","linkedToInspection":false},{"id":1419,"date":"2019-08-02","url":"https://static.propublica.org/fda-inspection-documents/483s/2024-10376%2F483s%2F2024-9235%2F2023-6697encl3.pdf","linkedToInspection":true},{"id":1418,"date":"2018-12-14","url":"https://static.propublica.org/fda-inspection-documents/483s/2024-10376%2F483s%2F2024-9235%2F2023